    <field_lsb>0</field_lsb>
    <rel_range>0</rel_range>
    <field_description order="before"><para>Controls which cached information the invalidation operation applies to.</para>
<para>When this field is 0, the operation invalidates cached information from the single level 2 DTE specified by <register_link id="its_config_frame.its_didr.xml" state="">ITS_DIDR</register_link>.DEVICE_ID.</para>
<para>When this field is 1, the operation invalidates cached information from the level 1 DTE specified by <register_link id="its_config_frame.its_didr.xml" state="">ITS_DIDR</register_link>.DEVICE_ID as well as any level 2 DTE covered by the range of DeviceIDs given by <register_link id="its_config_frame.its_dt_cfgr.xml" state="">ITS_DT_CFGR</register_link>.L2SZ for the DeviceID specified in <register_link id="its_config_frame.its_didr.xml" state="">ITS_DIDR</register_link>.DEVICE_ID.</para>
<para>If <register_link id="its_config_frame.its_dt_cfgr.xml" state="">ITS_DT_CFGR</register_link>.STRUCTURE is 0, the effective value of this field is 0.</para></field_description>
    <field_values impdef="False">
